error[E0409]: this type can't cross into a callback
  --> tests/programs/m3/e0409.la:1:30
  |
1 | extern fun ask(cb: fun(i64): string);
  |                              ^^^^^^
  |
  = help: a callback's parameters and result are numbers, `bool`, handles (`extern type`) or `Option` of a handle; its parameters may also be `string` or `Option<string>`, copied from C, but it can't return one: C would keep a pointer into Lugha's memory

For more about E0409, run `lughac explain E0409`.
